    "updated_at": "2023-09-01T19:25:27Z",
    "body": "About the second paragraph, I did test setting it right after the open method, but as you said, our device is affected by any alteration in the RTS line. What you suggested in the third paragraph would be ideal, as we have tested with the electron-serialport library on node.js running locally and if we had a way to set the RTS upon opening the port, that would be perfect. But my main concern with an API level change would be whether or not this change would be easy to dissipate for users of our application. ",
