    "created_at": "2023-09-01T21:20:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-01T21:20:23Z",
    "body": "After doing a bit more research it looks like setting the initial RTS and DTR state is only supported on Windows. macOS and Linux systems will always assert these pins when the port is opened. At best this means that if we implemented the option to control the signal state when the port is opened the lines would flash briefly into the high state before being reset during initial port configuration.\r\n\r\nI recommend working with your hardware vendor to not reuse the RTS line for an unintended purpose.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
